# CartIQ 2.0 Rules

- Do not rewrite working logic (stores, needSearch, trustScore) unless instructed; refactor UI around it.
- Use only design tokens from tailwind.config.js (ink, brand, action, match, good, bad, warn, surface, line). No raw hex.
- Amber (action) = primary actions with dark text (#1A1A1A). Indigo (match) = CartIQ intelligence only.
- Prices use tabular numerals and formatCurrency (Indian grouping).
- Icons must be semantically correct; never reuse for unrelated meanings.
- No unrelated stock photography; use ProductImage only.
- Sentence-case, active voice, specific CTAs. Errors state problem + fix. Empty states give next action.
- Focus-visible ring visible; 44px min touch target on mobile; aria-label on icon-only.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion; no decorative animation.
- Mobile-first (360/768/1280/1920). Max-width 1280px; full-bleed backgrounds.
- Components < 200 lines, JSDoc props, in ui/layout/features.
- List changed files and uncertainties after finishing. No invented requirements.